From: Qore Technologies <info@qore.org>
Subject: [PATCH] v8: reject unnamed page permission values

Copyright 2026 Qore Technologies, s.r.o.

The permission bitset converter must terminate for unnamed enum values instead
of falling through its return path. Keep the exhaustive named-value switch.

--- a/deps/v8/src/base/virtual-address-space.cc
+++ b/deps/v8/src/base/virtual-address-space.cc
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ uint8_t PagePermissionsToBitset(PagePermissions permissions) {
     case PagePermissions::kReadExecute:
       return 0b101;
   }
+  UNREACHABLE();
 }
 }  // namespace
 
